#24006
"Narrow Ravine outside Chiiron"
"From this location you are presented with an excellent view of the mountainous
terrain of this region.  The village of Chiiron, directly to the west, is set
on the inside face of a mountain range surrounding a large sea.  A heavy mist
rolls in waves over the surface of the black water, occasionally making
visible a barge or merchantman crossing from shore to shore.  Far to the
southeast, majestic mountains pierce the dark clouds encircling them, a path
here cuts between two sheer rock faces, sloping sharply down the hill to the
east.
"
""
